# The Singapore-guide fragment is generated by the tw2sg pipeline and injected
# verbatim via dangerouslySetInnerHTML. It must stay byte-for-byte LF: with
# core.autocrlf=true a checkout would rewrite it to CRLF, the HTML parser then
# normalises CRLF back to LF in the DOM, and React logs a hydration mismatch on
# every page view (caught live 2026-08-06). Narrow rule on purpose — do not
# renormalise the rest of the repo.
content/singapore-guide/*.html -text
